# Spec §6 / codex f1ed6ea9 (+ registry swap, codex 0c147646/97ea103a):
# everything in this directory except __init__.py is a BUILD PRODUCT of
# runtime/scripts/generate_method_bindings.py (fed by work package A's
# canonical generated JSON). It must never be committed — hand-copied method
# identity is forbidden. __init__.py (and this .gitignore) keep the
# _generated/ package in git so setuptools package-data (pyproject.toml) has a
# stable location once the image build runs the generator.
*.json
*.py
!__init__.py
